{"id":"58cf1874e9c08d81","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-continuum-function.md","title":"Continuum Function","display":"df-continuum-function — Continuum Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-continuum-function","aliases":["58-df-continuum-function"],"display":"df-continuum-function — Continuum Function","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-continuum-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-continuum-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-continuum-function — Continuum Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9a96ab954b6013e\" href=\"?note=e9a96ab954b6013e\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md\">../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuumValue}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuumValue}_S\\)</span> (continuum-function graph predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuum\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuumValue}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\lambda=2^\\kappa\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuum\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuumValue}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\lambda=2^\\kappa\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The continuum hypothesis is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuumValue}_S(\\aleph_0,\\aleph_1)\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuumValue}_S(\\aleph_0,\\aleph_1)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>GCH states <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuumValue}_S(\\kappa,\\kappa^+)\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuumValue}_S(\\kappa,\\kappa^+)\\)</span> for every infinite cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Easton's theorem: GCH can be violated systematically at regular cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md","status":"resolved","id":"e9a96ab954b6013e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuumValue}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuum\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuumValue}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\lambda=2^\\kappa","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuumValue}_S(\\aleph_0,\\aleph_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuumValue}_S(\\kappa,\\kappa^+)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1013,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-361","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-continuum-function.md|58-df-continuum-function]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["e9a96ab954b6013e","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}